        </p>

        <h4 style="font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green); font-size: 1.75rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">
          • Cancellation After Booking or Dispatch
        </h4>
        <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;">
          Once booked, picked up, or dispatched, international courier freight and third-party logistics costs are non-refundable. A customer changing their mind after dispatch is therefore not automatically entitled to a full refund. If an in-transit recall is operationally possible, Ghar Aangan will determine the recoverable amount after deducting outbound freight, return freight, and administrative handling.
        </p>

        <h4 style="font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green); font-size: 1.75rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">
